# US-0137 policy/audit JSONL (OS-config / temp only; never the project tree)
**/policy-audit.jsonl
**/policy-approvals.json

# US-0139 derived map metadata + runtime context packs (not the index DB)
docs/engineering/codebase-map.meta.json
